{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Note: Fire &amp; Light is currently in development. To follow the progress of the project and join the community, find us on  Discord, and the Trigor Tech YouTube channel.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire &amp; Light</strong> is a survivor game set in an evolving open world, with heroes who can evolve during the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/3f8d048bad15bc8ef76492058e2e04d2.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Tyberion</strong>\u00a0devoured by <strong>Betrayal,</strong>\u00a0many heroes have sworn an oath\u2014and are determined to keep it, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8fa189756c7d21d09bda3f88c7a5e87e.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive in a hostile world against endless hordes of enemies.<br>Your attacks trigger automatically in the direction of your stick, letting you focus on impact, dodging, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/996e6c48bf110c0521e8df401c4684b6.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, choose a new <strong>power card</strong> from over a hundred options\u2014endless replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/060d8e53420005b7f0df55e6ce772dd4.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your <strong>hero class</strong> during the run! When the conditions are met, choose between two stronger new classes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8d5eff518393fa908136e31d9c560551.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock new features and expand the universe. The world of Tyberion grows as you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/96f61d88050356511c71d294d1a5f454.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help each hero <strong>discover themselves</strong>, grow, and claim their place through intimate moments you can unlock\u2014revealing their most powerful abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/5d3208852d03645ef15aa7c86fa934f8.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>Oaths</strong> to make your runs harder, but also to rebuild Tyberion with special buildings that help you go further each time\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/78bc924f29b89ec16e45ba038516d107.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game over leaves a <strong>grave</strong> in the world... You can return in the next run to honor it with a rose\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/5190fdade8b10bc405e244973664839c.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you can <strong>break your oath</strong> and <strong>loot the grave</strong> to retrieve a powerful artifact from your past life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c18c2737f1adb1a08d703f46d606cb9f.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in a world already corroded by <strong>Betrayal</strong>\u2026 are you sure <i>you</i> want to break your oaths too?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884300?t=1757002152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/147cc03d86a018c176375cc1538ad7a29d7c74e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757002152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/229df8d02ae5e6e4598429fe91eb7a58b0ff530d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757002152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/229df8d02ae5e6e4598429fe91eb7a58b0ff530d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757002152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains fantasy violence, dark themes, and suggestive character poses."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Note: Fire &amp; Light is currently in development. To follow the progress of the project and join the community, find us on  Discord, and the Trigor Tech YouTube channel.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire &amp; Light</strong> is a survivor game set in an evolving open world, with heroes who can evolve during the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/3f8d048bad15bc8ef76492058e2e04d2.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Tyberion</strong>\u00a0devoured by <strong>Betrayal,</strong>\u00a0many heroes have sworn an oath\u2014and are determined to keep it, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8fa189756c7d21d09bda3f88c7a5e87e.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive in a hostile world against endless hordes of enemies.<br>Your attacks trigger automatically in the direction of your stick, letting you focus on impact, dodging, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/996e6c48bf110c0521e8df401c4684b6.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, choose a new <strong>power card</strong> from over a hundred options\u2014endless replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/060d8e53420005b7f0df55e6ce772dd4.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your <strong>hero class</strong> during the run! When the conditions are met, choose between two stronger new classes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/8d5eff518393fa908136e31d9c560551.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock new features and expand the universe. The world of Tyberion grows as you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/96f61d88050356511c71d294d1a5f454.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help each hero <strong>discover themselves</strong>, grow, and claim their place through intimate moments you can unlock\u2014revealing their most powerful abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/5d3208852d03645ef15aa7c86fa934f8.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>Oaths</strong> to make your runs harder, but also to rebuild Tyberion with special buildings that help you go further each time\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/78bc924f29b89ec16e45ba038516d107.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game over leaves a <strong>grave</strong> in the world... You can return in the next run to honor it with a rose\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/5190fdade8b10bc405e244973664839c.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you can <strong>break your oath</strong> and <strong>loot the grave</strong> to retrieve a powerful artifact from your past life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c18c2737f1adb1a08d703f46d606cb9f.avif?t=1757002152\" width=396 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in a world already corroded by <strong>Betrayal</strong>\u2026 are you sure <i>you</i> want to break your oaths too?</p>","developers":["Trigor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","